@startuml
title State Diagram - Packet Lifecycle

[*] --> Created

Created --> RoutingRequested : findRoute()
RoutingRequested --> RouteFound : route exists
RoutingRequested --> RouteNotFound : route missing

RouteNotFound --> [*]

RouteFound --> InTransit : sendPacket()

InTransit --> InTransit : move to next hop / TTL decreases
InTransit --> Delivered : destination reached
InTransit --> Expired : TTL <= 0

Delivered --> [*]
Expired --> [*]

@enduml
